    "body": "The maintainer approved the regeneration of the 19 Carvera NC goldens in the question dialog on 2026-11-14. They are regenerated in the new commit.\n\nDiff shape: only the 19 Carvera golden files changed. In each file, after each `M6`, the `G0 X.. Y..` line and the `G0 Z..` line change places. No line is added or removed. `two_tool_pocket.nc` has two such swaps. The total is 20 swaps.\n\nTest results on this head (main merged in first, no conflicts):\n- `camcraft-post --test script_carvera`: 11 pass.\n- `camcraft-post --test first_traverse_clearance`: 8 pass.\n- `camcraft-app --test carvera_post`: 4 pass.\n- `camcraft-app --test conformance`: 7 pass.\n\nThe PR is still a draft.\n",
